{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "32b1714cf5ad4a6cd76e5d655d0d1e120f1fe70ec86421dea2d651ddecdd0508", "ja": "（そろそろ、次の公演の企画を考えないとな。\n出演者をどうしようか……）", "zh": "（差不多该考虑下一场公演的企划了。出演者该怎么办呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8d56ae050bfc5583dd9001a48c2e74c81856f0692495dcb4528a2a40c2571a22", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れさまです。\n……どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，您辛苦了。\n……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "5a8ab4de3175f4536303cf7c9589f24fd40e9c2a0f652e328968d5166b98e6f0", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "c8d06fbe68df696d8b0caf18df87acfd6aa085bbe8eec7110075ca580a31350b", "ja": "そうだ！　{$P$}さんは、\n好きなおもちの食べ方ってありますか？", "zh": "对了！{$P$}先生，您有没有喜欢的年糕吃法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "37f1e5bfb2f6b185d602738b409bb71cfd8881e3aaab37b575928438c9cb8165", "ja": "えっ、好きなおもちの食べ方……ですか？", "zh": "诶？喜欢的年糕吃法……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "c99dacba13673c9123e5d9c26a0d0e3db370f8c6e542357d4c55f13ec964d05e", "ja": "はい！　実家からたくさん送られてきたので、\n参考に聞いてみようかなって。", "zh": "是的！因为老家寄来了很多年糕，\n所以想问问看，参考一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "b296b3f5d7881e2c91aee47cf2d03e1607cca49b2a37872c8e73100e9d8c1972", "ja": "もちろん{$P$}さんにもおすそ分けを\n持ってきたので、召し上がってくださいね♪", "zh": "当然也给{$P$}先生带了一份，请享用吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a7c6a881a39d508b05d36694d6543ec4d8a2b92d76cd3e1cf3d6eb8453267a1d", "ja": "あっ、ありがとうございます！\nおもちといえば、そうですね……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您！\n说到年糕嘛，没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "b23850fe326ea448761f1c22ad4c88823abaaad84396a9fb454cbb648b27ebbd", "ja": "じーっ…………あっ！？\nいけない、大事なことを忘れてました！", "zh": "一直盯着…………啊！？\n糟糕，我忘了一件重要的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c23ec620c59e8e8fd77f09fa82250b1fac56a9ed87f27c09578d44f689aaf94b", "ja": "ど、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "da3524f245800c2c191e288b3f6f2aace5c689236d7d0fae01d5ccf091642743", "ja": "社長さんから{$P$}さんに\n伝言があったんです！　事務所に来てほしいって……。", "zh": "社长那边有话要转告{$P$}先生！说是希望你能来一趟事务所……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "bce3f30f360143fcaa98a8a7a971eed7a6677255b928d494c0624a51962ffc13", "ja": "ごめんなさい。\nつい、頭がおもちでいっぱいになっちゃって……。", "zh": "对不起。\n一不小心，脑子里全是年糕了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "de1c4fab898b81bcd245efaf1efb2c2c058ca16b40a6815a6270918a246f403a", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ！\nとりあえず、事務所に行ってきますね。", "zh": "没事的！\n那我先去一趟剧场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "f0a6302ae1007dd873b2483ce0d7a9730bf09145a3d819838425c6747110cc14", "ja": "はーい、いってらっしゃーい！\n外は寒いですから、風邪をひかないでくださいね～♪", "zh": "好——路上小心呀！\n外面很冷，可别感冒了哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "2948e500b7a981232680e211db2fe6b78eabc1fa0cb6e75acc82a89801c8f6ff", "ja": "わあ……！　こっちの柄も素敵ですね、社長。\n目移りしちゃいます。", "zh": "哇……！这边的花纹也很漂亮呢，社长。\n真让人挑花眼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "89376354ac2c737aa2b9dac25076b6118e8a064341570664a6a073ba8cc53c36", "ja": "うむ、こちらも素晴らしい色合いだな……。\nさすが、本友禅だね！", "zh": "嗯，这边的色调也很棒啊……\n真不愧是正宗友禅绸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6faa7618acbf63a07fdfdd7b8d34afa294b26dd76cf0c6c5822a590756ae2daa", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです。\n……？　おふたりとも、何をしているんですか？", "zh": "社长，音无女士，辛苦了。\n……？　你们两位，在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "a468df2fea4b80fc57631a24c8a56ffe0cf6514bafe6a84a9489c64f05209951", "ja": "おや、ちょうどいいところに。\n君は本当に、タイミングがいいね！", "zh": "哎呀，来得正是时候。\n你真的很会挑时机呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "b45e3046228813594fa34700a09282b5c8a7dffa7100fb94c951cf1350f9c307", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n紬ちゃんの実家から届いた、反物の見本ですよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n这是紬的老家寄来的布料小样哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bb55b3ff421d36e8cd057e475ba5ea4e682a6e46922bcb9939e7868da5b1455a", "ja": "紬の実家は、社長の知り合いでしたね。\n反物……もしかして、アイドルの衣装ですか？", "zh": "紬的家里和社长是熟人吧。反物……难道是偶像的服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "7fa08ef673000dad45c6e06abc32a8f87dcd35cbcb1f0a25eca95c95fcc983a7", "ja": "ははは、さすがいいカンをしている！\nそう、次のユニットを考えるにあたってね。", "zh": "哈哈哈，不愧是直觉敏锐！\n没错，我正在考虑接下来的组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "82aa210d06ece55c119afb0bca0724692c1414e64ff8f5e83193731729ac5d18", "ja": "白石君のご実家に協力してもらって、\n和風の衣装を作ってみようと考えたわけだ。", "zh": "我想着请白石君的家里帮忙，试着制作一套和风服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "8e027f3b8c2daa2bfc795d1275329c9c4a4b7d5a9c4a75aecf7aa14903d494f6", "ja": "和風の衣装ですか、なるほど……。\n衣装先行というのは、面白い試みですね！", "zh": "和风服装吗，原来如此……\n服装先行的思路，倒是挺有意思的尝试呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "eb58cbc489dc9689c5a13c4f3ca0957442ac1978f6e8b0486e9b2cc3cf0ad34a", "ja": "そうだろう、そうだろう？　アイドル諸君の\nプロデュースには、遊び心が肝心だからね！", "zh": "是吧，是吧？在制作各位偶像时，\n有一颗玩心可是关键！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "09d8b5cac23bafe6dc8c8bc44d6a190069917afdf2d177abf2c67f01bdad55e2", "ja": "どんな衣装になるかとか、誰が着るのかとか……。\n想像するだけで、楽しみになってきちゃいますよね♪", "zh": "会是什么样的服装、由谁来穿……光是想象一下，就让人开始期待起来了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "f47d13cc6e5a80eb3b287de85ad19eac741633ce3f7cf27b9fdeb0809f13d5ab", "ja": "もちろん、新曲も用意するつもりだ！\nさて、そこで……今日君を呼んだのは他でもない。", "zh": "当然，我也打算准备新歌！\n那么，我今天叫你来，正是为了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "5696d65dec17934abfa373c92be44d884d572c32e1e473904817299555f16c45", "ja": "この和風ユニットを、君に任せたいと思う。\nどうだろう、引き受けてくれるかね？", "zh": "我想把这个和风组合交给你来负责。\n怎么样，愿意接下这个任务吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "84e40a4872e8737c65ce2e4bd672ba52a91d930605ab843936e23ebb6fc54e2f", "ja": "和風ユニットのプロデュース……わかりました！\n社長や音無さんの期待に、応えてみせます！", "zh": "负责和风组合的制作……我明白了！\n我一定会回应社长和音无小姐的期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "410d4d38a3a3422b97aa0f096defa31613ca79ae91be2ebeb5b7be35f23f340f", "ja": "わぁ、頼もしいお返事ですね♪\nちなみに、メンバーは誰になりそうですか？", "zh": "哇，回答得真让人安心呢♪\n顺便问一下，成员大概会定谁呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "6d5271cbefbba1d490ddab31503c377c8ff972f2b4fe31b3e755d49cd1fa1088", "ja": "そうですね。和装といえば紬に、朋花……。\nあとは、エミリーがいいんじゃないでしょうか？", "zh": "是啊。说到和装，我觉得紬和朋花……  \n另外，艾米莉也不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "c6477296e6de36cfc15d51a1046eeda15cffec8b9b7ddd7862d342a5a3816025", "ja": "なるほど、トリオか……いいね！\n文句のつけようがない人選だ。", "zh": "原来如此，是三人组啊……不错！\n这阵容挑得无可挑剔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1032_101kot", "source_sha256": "272fdfa19041c95d32609ac92fbcfcb173cd1d4a4e390930451d225dffed6305", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、朋花ちゃん、紬ちゃん。\n素敵なユニットになりそうですね……うふふ♪", "zh": "艾米莉、小朋花、紬。\n感觉会组成一个很棒的组合呢……呜呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "759ac28fa64ff7842e78d015eefe73a25e30259f4d078a99bd9cac648637f5d4", "ja": "アイドル達の優雅さや、凛とした和の魅力……\n存分に、引き出してあげてくれたまえ！", "zh": "尽情展现偶像们的优雅，以及凛然端庄的和风魅力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0119_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "22071909aed7cd5c377b61bbd8b1e182c9845133fd164014ec2faedaa391b14d", "ja": "（紬、朋花、エミリーで和風ユニット……うん。\n面白い公演ができそうだ！）", "zh": "（紬、朋花和艾米莉组成和风组合……嗯。感觉能办出一场有趣的公演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
